MiniWx

This GPL-3.0 project contains independently simplified implementations inspired by
public WeChat enhancement projects, especially their DexKit method-location and
local UI-hook approaches:

WeKit: https://github.com/Ujhhgtg/WeKit
WCXLC: https://github.com/Kimjaejiang/WCXLC
DexKit: https://github.com/LuckyPray/DexKit

WeKit and WCXLC are distributed under GNU GPL v3.0. MiniWx remains GPL-3.0.

MiniWx does not include Xposed/Root/Zygisk concealment, platform risk-control
bypass, network request forgery, bots, bulk actions, or automatic messaging.
